---
title: "setLegionAddress / getLegionAddress (LegionAddressRegistry)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_setEntry: setLegionAddress(id, updatedAddress)
    q_setEntry --> q_guardOwner: onlyOwner
    q_guardOwner --> q_getPrevious: previousAddress = s_legionAddresses[id]
    q_getPrevious --> q_update: s_legionAddresses[id] = updatedAddress
    q_update --> q_emit: emit LegionAddressSet(id, previousAddress, updatedAddress)
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    [*] --> q_getEntry: getLegionAddress(id)
    q_getEntry --> q_lookup: return s_legionAddresses[id]
    q_lookup --> [*]: return address

    note right of q_guardOwner
        INV-001: Only owner can update address mappings
        INV-002: Registry used by all contracts to resolve Legion addresses
    end note

    note right of q_update
        INV-003: syncLegionAddresses on sale contracts reads from this registry
        INV-004: Address change propagates on next sync call
    end note
